&lt;td colspan="5" style="border-left: 0px none #000000; border-top: 1px solid #000000; border-right: 0px none #000000; border-bottom: 0px none #000000; width: 352px; vertical-align: middle; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-top: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px"&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 6px; margin-right: 6px; text-align: center; line-height: 18px"&gt;（既発行株式数－自己株式数）＋ 新規株式発行数&lt;/p&gt;
